&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Every Identity, from AI to Human&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Identity is the key to unlocking the potential of AI. Okta secures AI by building the trusted, neutral infrastructure that enables organizations to safely embrace this new era. This work requires a relentless drive to solve complex challenges with real-world stakes. We are looking for builders and owners who operate with speed and urgency and execute with excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to do career-defining work. We&#39;re all in on this mission. If you are too, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Technical Account Manager (TAM) – Strategic Accounts&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Okta: The World’s Identity Company™&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;Okta is the leader in Identity management and The World’s Identity Company™. Our mission is to build a more secure world. Okta provides a neutral, powerful, and extensible platform that puts identity at the heart of your stack. Our platforms secure all types of identity, including customers, employees, partners, and AI agents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;Top brands trust Okta. We are relied upon by two thirds of the Fortune 100 and over 40% of the Forbes Global 2000 for their Identity-powered journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;The Strategic Accounts Opportunity&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Okta Platform Focus:&lt;/strong&gt; Primary focus on Workforce Identity Solutions (Okta WIC), with foundational Customer Identity (Auth0) exposure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Segment Scope:&lt;/strong&gt; Strategic Accounts (Global enterprise clients with high-complexity, multi-org hybrid environments).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; Some travel is required, including in-person onboarding and travel to our San Francisco, CA HQ OR Chicago office during the first week of employment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;This role is integral to the Strategic Segment team. As a P3 Technical Account Manager, you will serve as the primary technical advisor and advocate for a portfolio of Okta&#39;s largest, most complex global enterprises across industries such as Public Sector, Financial Services, Healthcare, Manufacturing, Retail, and Technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot;&gt;Key Identity Solutions &amp;amp; Technologies You Will Support&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16&quot;&gt;You will guide enterprise customers through complex deployment architectures across core workforce solutions and developer-focused identity integrations:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;17&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;17,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Workforce Identity Cloud (Primary Focus):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;17,0,1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;17,0,1,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,0,1,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Identity &amp;amp; Access Management (IAM):&lt;/strong&gt; Single Sign-On (SSO), Adaptive MFA, Device Access, API Access Management, Secure Partner Access, Access Gateway, and Universal Directory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;17,0,1,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,0,1,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Identity Governance &amp;amp; Administration (IGA):&lt;/strong&gt; Lifecycle Management, Workflows, and Identity Governance (automated SCIM provisioning and zero standing privileges).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;17,0,1,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,0,1,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Privileged Access Management (PAM):&lt;/strong&gt; Privileged Access controls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;17,0,1,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,0,1,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Identity Threat Detection &amp;amp; Response (ITDR):&lt;/strong&gt; Identity Security Posture Management, Identity Threat Protection, and Syslog integration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;17,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Customer Identity &amp;amp; Developer Tools:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;17,1,1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;17,1,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Modern authentication protocols (&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,1,1,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;33&quot;&gt;OAuth 2.0, OIDC&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;17,1,1,1,0&quot;&gt;Direct API interactions using &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,1,1,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;30&quot;&gt;Okta REST APIs&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;17,1,1,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,1,1,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Okta Sign-In Widget&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,1,1,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;24&quot;&gt;Auth JS&lt;/strong&gt; SDKs for custom application authentication and login UI customization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;19&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;20&quot;&gt;Strategic Partnership &amp;amp; Account Leadership&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;21&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;21,0,0&quot;&gt;Act as the primary technical authority and trusted advisor for identity leads, enterprise architects, and technical executives within your assigned strategic accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;21,1,0&quot;&gt;Independently design and drive multi-year technical adoption roadmaps aligned with customer security posture and business goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;21,2,0&quot;&gt;Partner closely with Customer Success Managers (CSMs) and Account Executives to secure Okta’s footprint against competitive displacement and identify expansion opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;22&quot;&gt;Technical Execution, API Prototyping &amp;amp; Advocacy&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;23&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;23,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;23,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Hands-On Demos &amp;amp; PoCs:&lt;/strong&gt; Configure test environments (e.g., Salesforce developer tenants) and build Proofs of Concept (PoCs) to demonstrate live SAML/OIDC integrations, custom login widgets, and Adaptive MFA policies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;23,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;23,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;API Validation &amp;amp; Scripting:&lt;/strong&gt; Use &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;23,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;32&quot;&gt;Postman&lt;/strong&gt; to test and validate Okta REST APIs (executing CRUD operations for user/group lifecycle management and policy automation).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;23,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;23,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Complex Problem Resolution:&lt;/strong&gt; Dissect multi-faceted enterprise issues, proactively identify technical risks, and independently drive escalations through Engineering and Support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;23,3,0&quot;&gt;Serve as the voice of the strategic customer internally, influencing Okta product management and roadmap decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;24&quot;&gt;Thought Leadership &amp;amp; Mentorship&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;25&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;25,0,0&quot;&gt;Deliver custom technical workshops, architectural reviews, and best-practice sessions for customer engineering teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;25,1,0&quot;&gt;Develop repeatable technical assets, Postman collections, and deployment strategy guides for the global TAM organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;25,2,0&quot;&gt;Mentor P1/P2 peers, driving team enablement and technical capability expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;27&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring to the Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;28&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;28,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;28,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of related technical experience in customer-facing engineering roles (or 4+ years with a Master’s degree), including 3+ years as a Technical Account Manager, Solutions Architect, Technical Consultant, or Senior Support Engineer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;28,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;28,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Domain Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; 3+ years in identity and access management (SSO, MFA, directory services, lifecycle management, or zero trust architectures).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;28,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;28,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Education &amp;amp; Certifications:&lt;/strong&gt; BA/BS/MS in Computer Science, Information Technology, or related technical discipline (or equivalent experience). Okta Certified Administrator/Consultant, CISSP, or equivalent certifications preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;29&quot;&gt;Technical Mastery&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;30&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;30,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Federation &amp;amp; Protocols:&lt;/strong&gt; Practical mastery of &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;45&quot;&gt;OAuth 2.0&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;56&quot;&gt;OpenID Connect (OIDC)&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;79&quot;&gt;SAML 2.0&lt;/strong&gt;, and WS-Federation protocols.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;30,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;API Prototyping Tools:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on proficiency using &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;50&quot;&gt;Postman&lt;/strong&gt; to execute REST API requests, manage environments/collections, and troubleshoot API integrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;30,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Development &amp;amp; Web Basics:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to read and modify simple web applications (e.g., HTML/JS, Node.js, Python) to demonstrate authentication flows, public vs. protected route logic, and group-based access control using the &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;222&quot;&gt;Okta Sign-In Widget&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;245&quot;&gt;Okta Auth JS&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;30,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Enterprise Ecosystems:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience integrating major SaaS platforms (Salesforce, Workday, Office 365, Box) via SAML, SCIM, and automated provisioning workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;30,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Security &amp;amp; SIEM:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with risk-based authentication policies, behavioral analysis, and syslog monitoring/SIEM integrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;31&quot;&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Executive Presence&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;32&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;32,0,0&quot;&gt;Strong communication skills with proven ability to translate complex technical concepts for both developer/architect teams and C-level stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;32,1,0&quot;&gt;Confident performing live technical demonstrations, interactive whiteboarding, and real-time troubleshooting under pressure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;32,2,0&quot;&gt;Strong project management capabilities with a track record of driving technical health across high-stakes accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;P15366_3558260&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-CM&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Below is the annual On Target Compensation (OTE) range for candidates located in California (excluding San Francisco Bay Area), Colorado, Illinois, New York and Washington. Your actual OTE, which is inclusive of base salary and incentive compensation, will depend on factors such as your skills, qualifications, experience, and work location. In addition, Okta offers equity (where applicable) and benefits, including health, dental and vision insurance, 401(k), flexible spending account, and paid leave (including PTO and parental leave) in accordance with our applicable plans and policies. To learn more about our Total Rewards program please visit:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://rewards.okta.com/us&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;https://rewards.okta.com/us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual OTE range for this position for candidates located in California (excluding San Francisco Bay Area), Colorado, Illinois, New York, and Washington is between:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$128,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$160,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Okta Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://rewards.okta.com&quot;&gt;Supporting Your Well-Being&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/okta-for-good/&quot;&gt;Driving Social Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/talent-connection-community/&quot;&gt;Developing Talent and Fostering Connection + Community&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are intentional about connection. Our global community, spanning over 20 offices worldwide, is united by a drive to innovate. Your journey begins with an immersive, in-person onboarding experience designed to accelerate your impact and connect you to our mission and team from day one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Okta is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, ancestry, marital status, age, physical or mental disability, or status as a protected veteran. We also consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and convictions records, consistent with applicable laws.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If reasonable accommodation is needed to complete any part of the job application, interview process, or onboarding please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1EfiEYZrIyhA2X4Fijk0R3RKYOzNoS3wtvyM4nhbZnXE/edit&quot;&gt;use this Form&lt;/a&gt; to request an accommodation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notice for New York City Applicants &amp;amp; Employees: Okta may use Automated Employment Decision Tools (AEDT), as defined by New York City Local Law 144, that use artificial intelligence, machine learning, or other automated processes to assist in our recruitment and hiring process. In accordance with NYC Local Law 144, if you are an applicant or employee residing in New York City, please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://talent.okta.com/new-york-city-aedt-notice.html&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to view our full NYC AEDT Notice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
